RELEASE_CANDIDATE

Version `2.0.0-rc.1` is the first 2.0 release-candidate development baseline.

The 2.0 line introduces native Codex and Claude Code host adapters, the unified
Python `governance.py` management interface, host-neutral governed-project
lifecycle handling, ownership-safe host configuration, and removal of the
legacy PowerShell/shell management entrypoints.

The frozen GOV-001..030 scenario definitions and scoring rubrics remain
unchanged. Candidate behavioral acceptance now requires independent complete
campaigns on both supported agent hosts: Codex and Claude Code.

Behavioral acceptance and exact-commit cross-platform assurance are not yet
complete. Version `1.0.0` remains the latest published stable release.

